  "description": "79 free developer, document and design tools that run entirely in your browser: combine Word documents into PDFs, merge, split and organise PDFs, convert Excel and PowerPoint files, compress images, generate QR codes, format JSON and SQL, test regexes and much more. No uploads, no accounts, no tracking.",
